<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Chinese 3 · Paper B · Optional preparation</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-3/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 3 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Optional preparation</h1><p>40 objective questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks · 90-minute section budget.</p><p class="note">Reference materials. Open the workspace for section clocks, local answer saving and recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or your own teacher; no automatic grade.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="student-traditional.html">繁體試卷</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Chinese 3 B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>Optional before-practice support. No pinyin is shown in the learner paper. This is an author-selected list, not a complete calibrated word list.</p><p class="cn">号码 <span class="note">participant number</span></p><p class="cn">主角 <span class="note">central figure</span></p><p class="cn">相册 <span class="note">photo album</span></p><p class="cn">思路 <span class="note">reasoning approach</span></p><p class="cn">圈出来 <span class="note">circle/mark</span></p><p class="cn">指示 <span class="note">directions/signs</span></p><p class="cn">路线图 <span class="note">route map</span></p><p class="cn">模型 <span class="note">model</span></p><p class="cn">上传 <span class="note">upload</span></p><p class="cn">草稿 <span class="note">draft</span></p><p class="cn">封面 <span class="note">cover</span></p><p class="cn">片段 <span class="note">extract/part</span></p><p class="cn">主角 <span class="note">main character</span></p><p class="cn">告别 <span class="note">say goodbye</span></p><p class="cn">香草 <span class="note">herbs</span></p><p class="cn">预约 <span class="note">reserve a place</span></p><p class="cn">浇水 <span class="note">water plants</span></p><p class="cn">天气预报 <span class="note">weather forecast</span></p><p class="cn">画具 <span class="note">drawing supplies</span></p><p class="cn">从容 <span class="note">unhurried</span></p><p class="cn">吉他 <span class="note">guitar</span></p><p class="cn">完美 <span class="note">perfect</span></p><p class="cn">坐垫 <span class="note">seat cushion</span></p><p class="cn">银幕 <span class="note">cinema screen</span></p><p class="cn">收线 <span class="note">gather cables</span></p><p class="cn">台边 <span class="note">beside the stage</span></p><p class="cn">例题 <span class="note">worked example</span></p><p class="cn">待确认 <span class="note">to be confirmed</span></p><p class="cn">光照 <span class="note">light conditions</span></p><p class="cn">乐器 <span class="note">musical instrument</span></p><p class="cn">排练 <span class="note">rehearse</span></p><p class="cn">简介 <span class="note">brief introduction</span></p><p class="cn">原句 <span class="note">original sentence/quotation</span></p><p class="cn">让座 <span class="note">offer a seat</span></p><p class="cn">短评 <span class="note">short review</span></p><p class="cn">进场 <span class="note">enter the performance area</span></p><p class="cn">量杯 <span class="note">measuring cup</span></p><p class="cn">搭档 <span class="note">partner</span></p><p class="cn">水量 <span class="note">amount of water</span></p><p class="cn">试行 <span class="note">trial implementation</span></p><p class="cn">居民 <span class="note">residents</span></p><p class="cn">顺序 <span class="note">sequence</span></p><p class="cn">补充 <span class="note">add further information</span></p><p class="cn">核对 <span class="note">check against a source</span></p><p class="cn">店主 <span class="note">shop owner</span></p></section></main></body></html>